    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons in hand, enemies in sight, you know what must be done, face death, over and over. Can you survive the brutal nightmare of OMUT?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by hardcore indie games of the early 2010s, OMUT invites players to experience a heart-pumping, blood rushing and brutalising, boss-rush game. Tasked with escaping a nightmarish, ominous forest and solving the riddle of the red pool, you must rely on quick wits and an even quicker, trigger finger. Customise your look, and your arsenal as you realise your potential, with each new encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/2ce57410c7c6f1902c883c5f374fd204.poster.avif?t=1751882043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/2ce57410c7c6f1902c883c5f374fd204.webm?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/2ce57410c7c6f1902c883c5f374fd204.mp4?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Punishing Boss Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brave the haunted forest and face nightmarish, with over 17 twisted bosses hiding in the shadows. Dodge, dash, and destroy your foes to unlock more weapon upgrades to temper the chaos with. Use every trick at your disposal to cling to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/aa371518047f73ff7d4bd1e9747a01eb.poster.avif?t=1751882043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/aa371518047f73ff7d4bd1e9747a01eb.webm?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/aa371518047f73ff7d4bd1e9747a01eb.mp4?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Traverse The Haunted Hollow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through the haunting woods, dawn deep into the depths by an ominous call. There, meet the locals: twisted creatures who speak of the mysterious and haunting Red Pool - a sacred place where the elusive enchantress resides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/73efae556b51994c98974eedbe9512dd.poster.avif?t=1751882043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/73efae556b51994c98974eedbe9512dd.webm?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/73efae556b51994c98974eedbe9512dd.mp4?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No dangers lurk there...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No hostility along your peaceful path...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No nightmares - swear it...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>And absolutely, <strong><u>absolutely no lies</u></strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mind the word of Baruch! Trust me.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons in hand, enemies in sight, you know what must be done, face death, over and over. Can you survive the brutal nightmare of OMUT?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by hardcore indie games of the early 2010s, OMUT invites players to experience a heart-pumping, blood rushing and brutalising, boss-rush game. Tasked with escaping a nightmarish, ominous forest and solving the riddle of the red pool, you must rely on quick wits and an even quicker, trigger finger. Customise your look, and your arsenal as you realise your potential, with each new encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/2ce57410c7c6f1902c883c5f374fd204.poster.avif?t=1751882043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/2ce57410c7c6f1902c883c5f374fd204.webm?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/2ce57410c7c6f1902c883c5f374fd204.mp4?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Punishing Boss Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brave the haunted forest and face nightmarish, with over 17 twisted bosses hiding in the shadows. Dodge, dash, and destroy your foes to unlock more weapon upgrades to temper the chaos with. Use every trick at your disposal to cling to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/aa371518047f73ff7d4bd1e9747a01eb.poster.avif?t=1751882043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/aa371518047f73ff7d4bd1e9747a01eb.webm?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/aa371518047f73ff7d4bd1e9747a01eb.mp4?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Traverse The Haunted Hollow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through the haunting woods, dawn deep into the depths by an ominous call. There, meet the locals: twisted creatures who speak of the mysterious and haunting Red Pool - a sacred place where the elusive enchantress resides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/73efae556b51994c98974eedbe9512dd.poster.avif?t=1751882043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/73efae556b51994c98974eedbe9512dd.webm?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997330/extras/73efae556b51994c98974eedbe9512dd.mp4?t=1751882043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No dangers lurk there...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No hostility along your peaceful path...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No nightmares - swear it...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>And absolutely, <strong><u>absolutely no lies</u></strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mind the word of Baruch! Trust me.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to OMUT, a horror-filled, hardcore, 2D boss rush experience in which every battle can swiftly become a mesmerising, hypnotic nightmare. Precise action and quick thinking may be your only routes to salvation. Can you survive this brutal fever dream?",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cOMUT is indescribable.\u201d<br>Graves, EIP Gaming<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s difficult, punishing, frustrating, tantalizing, alluring, cathartic, and glory-inducing all in one.\u201d<br>Andrew Otton, TechRaptor<br><br>\u201cOMUT is a beautiful and difficult breath of fresh air.\u201d<br>Kate S\u00e1nchez, But Why Tho?<br>",
